1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,470
This is a photo.

2
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,010
These are twelve.

3
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,710
Shared with people you know...
and people you don't.

4
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:16,510
To a stranger, every photo is a clue.

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:21,930
A house number.

6
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,290
A school crest.

7
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:26,680
A boarding pass.

8
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:32,620
On their own, harmless. Together, they
tell a story you never meant to share.

9
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,230
Introducing Clueproof.

10
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:45,970
It reads your photos the way a stranger
would... before anyone else can.

11
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:52,300
And it runs entirely
on your UGREEN AI NAS.

12
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:54,750
Your photos never leave home.

13
00:00:55,010 --> 00:00:56,600
Not even to be checked.

14
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:00,390
Just ask: is this safe to post?

15
00:01:02,430 --> 00:01:08,950
Three lines. Six photos are ready to post.
Four give clues away. Two need a fix.

16
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:17,130
Every photo is read twice: once for text,
once for what's in the picture.

17
00:01:17,350 --> 00:01:20,530
It never calls a photo
safe on a single look.

18
00:01:21,150 --> 00:01:23,390
And it never repeats what it found.

19
00:01:25,990 --> 00:01:30,850
Say yes, and your clean photos are
ready to share. The rest are remembered.

20
00:01:33,270 --> 00:01:37,690
Then ask the bigger question.
What could a stranger find out about us?

21
00:01:40,070 --> 00:01:45,150
Clueproof opens the Stranger's File.
Eight pages a stranger would try to fill.

22
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:49,780
Where you live. Your children.
Your car. When you're away.

23
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:55,200
And it shows you how to close every page.

24
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,790
Clueproof. Share the moment.
Not the clues.
